  "notes": "Released with an instruct version on 2024-04-17. The docs page covers versions 0.1 to 0.3 under one entry. The mistral-inference README lists mixtral-8x22B-v0.3 (the v0.1 base with an extended vocabulary of 32768 tokens) and mixtral-8x22B-Instruct-v0.3 (identical to Instruct v0.1, in safetensors format) as direct downloads; they were not announced as separate releases, so they are aliases here (see src.mistral.mistral-inference-repo). The docs page links https://legal.mistral.ai/ai-governance/models/mixtral-8-22b, which returns 404."
